    "Edit with AI":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Edit with AI"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعديل بالذكاء الاصطناعي"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用 AI 编辑"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mit KI bearbeiten"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modifier avec l’IA"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI की मदद से संपादित करें"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AIで編集"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Editar com IA"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Редактировать с ИИ"}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Editar con IA"}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Editar con IA"}}}},
