    "You haven't created any cards yet.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You haven't created any cards yet."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لم تنشئ أي بطاقات بعد."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你还没有创建任何卡片。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du hast noch keine Karten erstellt."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vous n’avez pas encore créé de cartes."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपने अभी तक कोई कार्ड नहीं बनाया है।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"まだカードを作成していません。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Você ainda não criou nenhum cartão."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вы еще не создали ни одной карточки."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no has creado ninguna tarjeta."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no has creado ninguna tarjeta."}}}},
    "You haven't created any cards yet. Add your first card to start studying.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You haven't created any cards yet. Add your first card to start studying."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لم تنشئ أي بطاقات بعد. أضف بطاقتك الأولى لبدء الدراسة."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你还没有创建任何卡片。添加第一张卡片即可开始学习。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du hast noch keine Karten erstellt. Füge deine erste Karte hinzu, um mit dem Lernen zu beginnen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vous n’avez pas encore créé de cartes. Ajoutez votre première carte pour commencer à étudier."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपने अभी तक कोई कार्ड नहीं बनाया है। पढ़ाई शुरू करने के लिए अपना पहला कार्ड जोड़ें।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"まだカードを作成していません。最初のカードを追加して学習を始めましょう。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Você ainda não criou nenhum cartão. Adicione seu primeiro cartão para começar a estudar."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вы еще не создали ни одной карточки. Добавьте первую карточку, чтобы начать учиться."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no has creado ninguna tarjeta. Agrega tu primera tarjeta para empezar a estudiar."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no has creado ninguna tarjeta. Añade tu primera tarjeta para empezar a estudiar."}}}},
    "You're all caught up for now. Come back later or add more cards.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You're all caught up for now. Come back later or add more cards."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لقد أنهيت كل ما عليك حاليًا. عُد لاحقًا أو أضف المزيد من البطاقات."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你目前已经全部复习完了。稍后再来，或添加更多卡片。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Du bist fürs Erste fertig. Komm später wieder oder füge weitere Karten hinzu."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vous êtes à jour pour le moment. Revenez plus tard ou ajoutez d’autres cartes."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"फिलहाल आपने सब पूरा कर लिया है। बाद में वापस आएं या और कार्ड जोड़ें।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"今のところ、復習はすべて完了しています。後で戻るか、カードを追加してください。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Você está em dia por enquanto. Volte mais tarde ou adicione mais cartões."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сейчас вы все повторили. Вернитесь позже или добавьте еще карточки."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Por ahora ya estás al día. Vuelve más tarde o agrega más tarjetas."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Por ahora ya estás al día. Vuelve más tarde o añade más tarjetas."}}}},
